		{
			"id": "pCK6M6yb",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 646.0620995630339,
			"y": 8613.187809441579,
			"width": 929.4992065429688,
			"height": 487.5446537965187,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 4,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b3W",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 925059495,
			"version": 787,
			"versionNonce": 1371757543,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1785791137734,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "1. The Load Balancer Fully handles incoming TCP handshakes\n\n\nIt is smart in nature and has more flexibility so we can implment\nmultiple algorithms\n\n1. Round Robin\n2. Least Connection\n3. weighted Round Robin\n4. Ip Hash\n5. Random\n\n\nExample : NGINX , AWS Alb\n",
			"rawText": "1. The Load Balancer Fully handles incoming TCP handshakes\n\n\nIt is smart in nature and has more flexibility so we can implment\nmultiple algorithms\n\n1. Round Robin\n2. Least Connection\n3. weighted Round Robin\n4. Ip Hash\n5. Random\n\n\nExample : NGINX , AWS Alb\n",
			"fontSize": 26.00238153581433,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "1. The Load Balancer Fully handles incoming TCP handshakes\n\n\nIt is smart in nature and has more flexibility so we can implment\nmultiple algorithms\n\n1. Round Robin\n2. Least Connection\n3. weighted Round Robin\n4. Ip Hash\n5. Random\n\n\nExample : NGINX , AWS Alb\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "M9UrnJt5WRY9cYuoks7_S",
			"type": "rectangle",
			"x": 644.4624423887147,
			"y": 9098.060774540541,
			"width": 590.977045036257,
			"height": 983.223049284377,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
